### 1. Health check
## expect 200 OK
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/health
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. POST invalid task 
## expect 400 Bad Request
### Invalid task (missing required fields)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": ""
}

### 3. POST valid task
## expect 201 Created
### Create valid task
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete API testing",
  "description": "Test task creation and validation",
  "completed": false
}

###4. GET missing task
## expect 404 Not Found
### Get task that does not exist
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/999999
Content-Type: application/json

### {
###  "error": "Task not found"
### }

### 5. Security header check 
## expect 200 OK
## X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
### Check Helmet security headers
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/health

### 6. GET /api/auth/me before login 
## — expect 401 Unauthorized
### Current user before login
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me

### 7. Register, login, then GET /me

### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "api-test@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!"
}

### Login
## 200
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "api-test@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!"
}

