### 9. Create a task, then test cache invalidation
### Step 1: Warm the cache
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks

### Step 2: Create a new task
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Verify cache invalidation",
  "description": "This task must appear in the next GET request",
  "completed": false
}

### Step 3: Fetch tasks again
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks

